\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 In The Convergence, the Interstellar Council serves as the central governing body within the human sphere of influence. Comprising representatives from every recognized human enclave, the council is a symbol of unity and cooperation, making decisions that shape the course of human society across the stars.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \strokec4 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 Decisions at the Interstellar Council are made through consensus rather than majority rule, reflecting the diversity and equal standing of all human enclaves. The council strives to ensure that all voices are heard and that decisions are made in the best interest of all, rather than favoring a particular group.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \strokec4 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 The council's responsibilities include setting laws and policies that apply across the human sphere, managing common resources, coordinating defense and security measures, and overseeing important bodies such as the Galactic Environmental and Life Protection Agency (GELPA). It was the Interstellar Council that passed the seminal Galactic Life Preservation Act, exemplifying the commitment of human society to the preservation and respect of all life forms.\
